    ...text(r'Every step is guarded. A name cargo would refuse is refused in the prompt, with the reason, before anything exists on disk. A parent directory that is already inside another workspace’s members, or inside a git work tree, gets a yes/no question. A cancelled prompt ends the command silently. A failed step removes exactly what that run created, parents included, and nothing else.'),
