    ...sec(r'the egui flow in one paragraph'),
    ...text(r':EguiNew asks for a crate name, an author name and e-mail (prefilled from git config, both may be empty) and a parent directory. It creates a hidden temporary directory inside that parent, downloads the template ZIP into it with curl, lists the archive and refuses any entry that is absolute, contains a backslash or climbs with .., unpacks it, checks that no symlink came out, renames the single top-level directory, rewrites the files, runs git init -b main, and finally renames the finished project to its place in one move. If anything fails the temporary directory is deleted; the target never exists half-built.'),
